      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Also to add this business model doesn't make sense at all. Why is it that we can upload hundreds of models to the game with no data limit as a free user but they want to charge us for extended avatar favorites and whatever else. Think about that. When you design something there needs to be consistency for your systems to work together.",
