      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The boost to the favorites system makes sense, it gives additions to an existing feature.\nThe icon situation does not, as it's an exclusive feature entirely locked behind a paywall. I don't think that should be the stance taken when it comes to adding new features. Possibly consider adding a version of it with icon amount or icon creation frequency limitations?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
