  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you want to market VRC+ at least do it fairly. Let your users set at least one icon for free. If your gonna introduce such features that competitors offer for free your inventing a new problem for people to complain about. Look at the like to dislike ratio on your YouTube promotional video and understand your wrong. Take an L and adjust. Microtransactions would be favored to increase slots as a one time payment or tack that solely onto a fair priced plus system at something like 2.99 a month for increased capacity.",
